.DS_Store
__pycache__/

# Derived from the odds archive on Desktop — rebuildable, never committed.
odds_analysis/data/
odds_analysis/out/

# Rendered post cards — rebuildable from cards/*.json via build_card.py.
brand/make_social_posts/out/

# Generated charts.
bet_tracking/WNBA/2025/discord_summary.png

# Source photos for the pick cards. Re-fetchable via
# .claude/skills/pick-post/get_photo.py, which records where each one came from
# in sources.json — that manifest is the part worth committing, not 30MB of
# wire photos we don't own. Photos already in history stay recoverable there.
# Exclude the CONTENTS, not the directory: git never descends into an excluded
# directory, so a `photos/` rule makes the negation below unreachable.
brand/make_social_posts/photos/*
!brand/make_social_posts/photos/sources.json
